BT /F1 11 Tf 54 760 Td 16 TL
(MOTH. They keep the greenhouse at sixty-two degrees.) Tj T*
(MOTH. The plants, not the people. The people) Tj T*
(       keep themselves at whatever they bring in.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(JUNE. \(entering\) You missed the note.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(MOTH. I saw the note. The note was wrong.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(JUNE. The note said the fern was dead.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(MOTH. The fern is resting.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(JUNE. The fern is compost with a sense of self.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(MOTH. Compost is just a plant planning its comeback.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(JUNE. That is not biology. That is a fortune cookie.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(MOTH. \(watering\) Everything in here is a fortune cookie) Tj T*
(       if you are hungry enough.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(JUNE. I came to say I am not doing the showcase.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(MOTH. \(does not look up\) I know.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(JUNE. You cannot know. I decided on the walk over.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(MOTH. I know because you are holding your program) Tj T*
(       like a shield instead of a schedule.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
