BT /F1 11 Tf 54 760 Td 16 TL
(JUNE. \(looking at it\) I am, a bit.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(MOTH. What happened?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(JUNE. They want the dance to be about the budget.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(MOTH. The budget?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(JUNE. We lost our space to a robotics lab.) Tj T*
(       So the piece is about the loss of the space.) Tj T*
(       Which they will stage in the space we lost.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(MOTH. That is very university.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(JUNE. It is extremely university.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(MOTH. So what would you make, if no one asked?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(JUNE. \(long pause\) Something with the fern.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(MOTH. The dead fern.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(JUNE. The resting fern. Something about how it) Tj T*
(       keeps its shape even after it stops.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(MOTH. \(finally looks up\) Do that one.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(JUNE. They will never approve it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(MOTH. This is a greenhouse. Everything in here) Tj T*
ET
endstream
