(MOTH. For the plants. You bring your own warmth.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(JUNE. \(beat\) I will think about it on the walk back.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(MOTH. Take the fern a glass of water. For morale.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(JUNE. It is dead.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
